msgid "**Access Locks**: a role-gated application (`services.sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`) shows a lock on its tile when the signed-in user holds none of its groups; the lock links to `web-svc-access-request` when that service is deployed, and asks an anonymous visitor to sign in. The tile always stays clickable, the SSO gate decides. Switch the locks off with `services.dashboard.locks.enabled: false`."
