msgid "**Admin Flag from the Administrator Group:** with SSO or LDAP, [`files/php/reconcile_admins.php`](./files/php/reconcile_admins.php) sets `is_admin` for the members of the `administrator` group and clears it for every other user; the platform administrator keeps it. It runs as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so an account the SAML or LDAP sign-in creates later gets the flag on the next run."
