# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup and disaster recovery.** *svc-bkp-container-2-local* is superseded by *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, making backup policy explicit per volume. The role prefers filesystem snapshots when available and can prepare btrfs hosts for snapshot-based backups itself. New *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* protects the shared NFS export, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* captures secret material, and *svc-bkp-local-2-device* synchronizes backups to mounted external media. A unified *recover* CLI drives restores, while Compose recovery checks and a full Swarm disaster-recovery drill continuously verify the path. Rsync no longer retains superseded files as *~* copies."
msgstr "**Babeskopia eta hondamendien berreskurapena.** *svc-bkp-container...2-local* honek gainditzen du *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, babeskopia-politika bolumenaren arabera esplizitua eginez. Rolak nahiago du fitxategi-sistemako argazkiak erabilgarri dagoenean eta btrfs ostalariak prestatzeko babeskopiak egiteko. Berria *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* NFS esportazio partekatua babesten du, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* ezkutuko materiala harrapatzen du, eta *svc-bkp-local-2-device* Babeskopiak kanpoko euskarriekin sinkronizatzen ditu. Bateratua *berreskuratu* CLI unitateek leheneratu egiten dute, eta Compose-ren berreskuratze-egiaztapenak eta Swarm-en hondamendiak berreskuratzeko zulagailu osoak etengabe egiaztatzen dute bidea. Rsync-ek ez ditu jadanik gainditutako fitxategiak gordetzen *~* kopiak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup free:** The volume is backup-disabled and its backup consumer stays off; every artefact in it is re-fetchable from its upstream."
msgstr "**Babeskopia librea:** Bolumena babeskopia-desgaituta dago eta bere babeskopia-kontsumitzailea itzali egiten da; bere artefaktu bakoitza bere korrontetik itzul daiteke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup integration:** Backup Docker Volumes snapshots the model volume when that role is present, without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Babeskopiaren integrazioa:** Babeskopiaren bolumenak ereduaren bolumena batzen du funtzio hori dagoenean, edukiontzia gelditu gabe."

msgid "**Backup lock:** The service waits for every backup, repair and optimizer unit before it starts, so a collector never races a live backup."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Backup scope:** The backup covers the cluster configuration (``proxmox_config``, the ``pmxcfs`` database) and the ISO and container templates (``proxmox_templates``, ``/var/lib/vz/template``). Everything under ``/var/lib/vz/images`` (``proxmox_vm_disks``) is not backed up: that covers the agent VM disks, which are destroyed when their task ends, and the base disks of the agent VM templates, which ``make agents-vm-template`` rebuilds."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Backup scope:** The backup covers the cluster configuration (`proxmox_config`, the `pmxcfs` database) and the ISO and container templates (`proxmox_templates`, `/var/lib/vz/template`). Everything under `/var/lib/vz/images` (`proxmox_vm_disks`) is not backed up: that covers the agent VM disks, which are destroyed when their task ends, and the base disks of the agent VM templates, which `make agents-vm-template` rebuilds."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup user SSH access was hardened:** backup keys are wrapped with a forced command wrapper and written via the shared user role; config is now users.backup.authorized_keys."
msgstr "**Babeskopiako erabiltzailearen SSH sarbidea gogortu egin zen:** babeskopia-teklak behartutako komando-itzultzaile batekin bildu eta erabiltzaile-rol partekatuaren bidez idatzi dira; konfigurazioa orain da users.backup.authorized_keys."

msgid "**Backup-disabled volumes skipped:** the directory of every NFS-backed volume declared ``backup: false`` in its role’s ``meta/volumes.yml`` is excluded, the same declaration `svc-bkp-volume-2-local <../svc-bkp-volume-2-local/>`__ honours; a directory a backed-up volume also binds to stays in the snapshot."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Backup-disabled volumes skipped:** the directory of every NFS-backed volume declared `backup: false` in its role's `meta/volumes.yml` is excluded, the same declaration [svc-bkp-volume-2-local](../svc-bkp-volume-2-local/) honours; a directory a backed-up volume also binds to stays in the snapshot."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Backup/cleanup services are more reliable:** run-once flags execute earlier, user-backup is an explicit dependency, and cleanback now uses a configurable backups root and keeps the newest backups by default (force-keep=3)."
msgstr "**Babeskopia/garbiketa zerbitzuak fidagarriagoak dira:** banderak lehenago exekutatzen direnean, user-backup mendekotasun esplizitua da, eta orain garbiketak babeskopia konfiguragarri bat erabiltzen du erroan eta babeskopia berrienak lehenetsi gisa gordetzen ditu. (force-keep=3)."

msgid "**Backups survive a file truncated mid-copy.** *baudolo* 7.0.2 lets the stopped checksum copy replace a live pre-copy that a writing container broke by truncating files under rsync, which used to abort the backup."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Bans and failed logins also go to the container output** (`STALWART_BAN_TRACER`, `tasks/tracing.yml`), next to the daily log file in the data volume."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Bans and failed logins also go to the container output** (``STALWART_BAN_TRACER``, ``tasks/tracing.yml``), next to the daily log file in the data volume."
