msgstr "**Break-glass admin** - administrari lokal bat lehen mailako morroiaren bidez hazi zen. (``/Startup``), SSO/LDAPetik aparte."

msgid "**Break-glass editing:** WP-CLI (``wp user update``) is the one path that changes the IdP-managed fields of an OIDC account; the next OIDC login overwrites them again."
