# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI DNS & Defaults:** Introduced CoreDNS-based *.localhost resolution (A/AAAA to loopback), set DOMAIN_PRIMARY to localhost, added DNS assertions and a strict default 404 vhost to stabilize early CI stages."
msgstr "**CI DNS & Lehenetsiak:** CoreDNS-en oinarritua *.localhost bereizmena (A/AAAA atzera egiteko), ezarri DOMAIN_PRIMARY ostalariari, DNS baieztapenak gehitu eta lehenetsi zorrotz bat 404 vhost CIren hasierako faseak egonkortzeko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI Debugging:** Greatly improved CI diagnostics by dumping resolved docker compose configuration and environment data in debug mode, with optional unmasked .env output."
msgstr "**CI arazketa:** CIren diagnostikoak hobetu egin dira ebatzitako docker-ak arazketa moduan konfigurazio- eta ingurune-datuak jaurtiz, aukerako maskararik gabeko .env irteerarekin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI Optimized:** Prevents GitHub Actions images from growing uncontrollably."
msgstr "**CI optimizatuta:** GitHub-en ekintzak irudiak kontrolik gabe haztea eragozten du."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and Tests**"
msgstr "**CI eta Testak**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and Tests:** New integration tests for portable python shebangs, forbid *sh -lc* with *pipefail*, and improved variable checks. CI stability improvements for per distro stacks and mirror resolver via venv Python, plus more robust package manager retries."
msgstr "**CI eta probak:** Python shebangs eramangarrietarako integrazio proba berriak, debekatu *sh-lc* honekin: *pipafailak*eta kontrol aldagarriak hobetu. CIren egonkortasunaren hobekuntzak pila bakoitzeko eta ispilu-ebaluatzailerako venv Python-en bidez, eta pakete-kudeatzailearen erreten sendoagoak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and diagnostics.** Deployment runs are planned separately per mode and divided into starred priority and regular lines, with branch-new roles scheduled first. Matrix entries serialize across branches, large lines serialize their deployment modes, and failed roles can be retriggered on the original distribution set; *--strict* limits this to hard failures. Cancelled runs can have their failed jobs rerun, and role failures on *main* open or update dedicated issues. Deployment stages are sourced from *categories.yml*."
msgstr "**CI eta diagnostikoak.** Hedapen-kurtsoak banan-banan planifikatuta daude, lehentasuna eta lerro erregularretan banatuta, eta adar-jokapen berriak programaturik daude. Matrize-sarrerak adar batetik bestera serializatzen dira, lerro handiek beren hedapen-moduak seriean hartzen dituzte, eta huts egindako rolak itzul daitezke jatorrizko banaketa-multzoan; *--strict* Honek porrot gogorretara mugatzen du. Bertan behera utzitako lanek huts egin dezakete, eta hutsegiteak gertatzen dira *nagusia* Ireki edo eguneratu kontu dedikatuak. Garapen-etapak hortik sortzen dira *categories.yml*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI deploys only the variants a change reaches.** An image bump in a provider no longer redeploys the variants of its consumers that switch that provider off. The diff-derived whitelist, used by the weekly update PRs, Dependabot and every other diff-driven run, narrows each affected role to the variants whose round closure still reaches a changed role, emitted as *role#0,2* selection tokens. A changed role and a role reached only through *run_after* keep every variant. A pinned token naming a role that discovery does not return now warns instead of aborting the run; role names are still checked against *roles/* before the run starts."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI images are built natively per architecture and published as one tag per distro.** Each architecture builds on its own runner, and [push.sh](../../../scripts/image/push.sh) pushes the result by digest only, so no per-architecture tag exists. [manifest_all.sh](../../../scripts/image/manifest_all.sh) then publishes the plain `<tag>` as a manifest list over every architecture's digest. Every consumer pulls the plain tag and gets the image matching its machine."
msgstr "**CI irudiak arkitekturaren arabera eraikitzen dira eta disko bakoitzeko etiketa bat bezala argitaratzen dira.** Arkitektura bakoitza bere lasterkariaren gainean eraikitzen da, eta [push.sh](../../../scripts/image/push.sh) Emaitza digestioaren bidez bakarrik bultzatzen du, beraz, ez dago aztarnarik. [manifest_all.sh](../../../scripts/image/manifest_all.sh) gero lautada argitaratzen du `<tag>` arkitektura bakoitzaren digestioaren gaineko zerrenda gisa. Kontsumitzaile bakoitzak etiketa garbia ateratzen du eta irudia makinarekin bat dator."

msgid "**CI runner-split.** The deploy-matrix discovery ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), wired via [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) gives every variant its own matrix entry (runner): a 5-variant role becomes five rows `0`…`4`, each carrying the deploy mode and network mode the sweep rotation assigned it. Each runner receives its variant through the `variant` env (consumed by `--variant`). Which rows a given run deploys is decided by the chunker ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py)), not by bundling."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runs a real Tor E2E** (`torsocks curl` against the minted onion) with retry logic; unit tests remain the merge-blocking base."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI selects, resumes and proves.** A fourth deploy chunk stops a short priority chunk stranding budget, a manual run can set the chunk size the formula would derive, and a retrigger can override the chunk gate. Retriggering works by role and by what never got a verdict, resumes behind the green window rather than the deployed one, retires suites the source run already passed, and cancels the run before retriggering its failed roles. Each role's README instructions are replayed on its smallest deploy row, in the mode its *services.yml* declares. Distro images build concurrently on one runner, the matrix job folds into the image job, and the deploy chunks no longer wait on the DNS test."
msgstr "**CIk hautatu, berrekin eta frogatzen du.** Laugarren zabaltze-zati batek lehentasunaren zati txiki bat gelditzen du, eskuzko exekuzio batek formularen zatiaren tamaina ezar dezake, eta atzera-graba batek zati-atea gaindi dezake. Paperez egindako lanak berrantolatzea eta inoiz epaia jaso ez zuena, leiho berdearen atzean berriro hastea, zabaldutakoa baino, iturburu-exekuzioa atzeratzen du eta exekuzioa bertan behera uzten du huts egindako rolak berriro sartu aurretik. Rol bakoitzaren instrukzioak bere zabaltze-errenkadarik txikienean erreproduzitzen dira, bere moduan. *services.yml* adierazten du. Distro-irudiak aldi berean egiten dira korrikalari batean, matrize-lana irudi-lanera tolestu egiten da, eta zati hedatuak ez dira DNS probaren zain geratzen."

