msgid "**Deferred reachability probe**: every vhost is queued, and ``tasks_from: deferred_probe.yml`` probes the queue in one parallel batch and empties it. The play runs it twice: after the shared-service preload and after the server roles. A vhost answering like a stale config restarts OpenResty once; one still unserved after that fails the deploy by name. A vhost whose config changed is additionally verified right after its reload."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Deferred reachability probe**: every vhost is queued, and `tasks_from: deferred_probe.yml` probes the queue in one parallel batch and empties it. The play runs it twice: after the shared-service preload and after the server roles. A vhost answering like a stale config restarts OpenResty once; one still unserved after that fails the deploy by name. A vhost whose config changed is additionally verified right after its reload."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Definition of done:** code complete, `make test` green, and a local compose measurement against `origin/main` that shows the saving."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Delegated Grants:** The application realm enables fine-grained admin permissions (v2) and records admin events, which it deletes after ``services.keycloak.events.admin.expiration_days``, a whole number of days above 0 (the role ships 365). Upgrade note: the first deploy to an existing realm sets this expiration, and Keycloak’s scheduled cleanup then permanently deletes every admin event older than 365 days; export them before that deploy if you need them. With `web-svc-access-request <../web-svc-access-request/README.md>`__ deployed, `15_admin_permissions.yml <tasks/update/15_admin_permissions.yml>`__ lets the platform administrators grant every role group and each application’s administrators grant the non-administrator roles of their application."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Delegated Grants:** The application realm enables fine-grained admin permissions (v2) and records admin events, which it deletes after `services.keycloak.events.admin.expiration_days`, a whole number of days above 0 (the role ships 365). Upgrade note: the first deploy to an existing realm sets this expiration, and Keycloak's scheduled cleanup then permanently deletes every admin event older than 365 days; export them before that deploy if you need them. With [web-svc-access-request](../web-svc-access-request/README.md) deployed, [15_admin_permissions.yml](tasks/update/15_admin_permissions.yml) lets the platform administrators grant every role group and each application's administrators grant the non-administrator roles of their application."
msgstr ""

