msgid "**Delivery:** every request mails the platform administrator's secondary address, or the primary one when it has none, through `lookup('email', application_id)`. With `web-app-zammad` deployed, it also files a Zammad ticket as the `access-request-zammad` agent, which [web-app-zammad](../web-app-zammad/) creates with the service's `zammad_api_token`. Both carry the review link and a link to the requester's groups in the Keycloak admin console. The requester gets a mail when the request is granted, partly granted or rejected."
