# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker Swarm as a second deployment mode.** Roles can now be deployed across multiple hosts instead of being limited to a single Compose stack. New *svc-swarm-node* initializes the cluster, while *svc-swarm-manager* marks the Raft managers in the inventory. Shared state is provided through *svc-storage-nfs-server* and *svc-storage-nfs-client*. *svc-registry-docker* distributes locally built images, and *svc-registry-cache* provides a Docker Hub pull-through cache so additional nodes do not multiply external pulls and rate-limit usage. Deployment, dependency resolution, networking, health checks and role templates now understand both Compose and Swarm semantics. See the [svc-swarm-node](roles/svc-swarm-node/README.md) and [svc-storage-nfs-server](roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/README.md) READMEs."
msgstr "**Docker Swarm bigarren inplementazio moduan.** Funtzioak ostalari anitzetan zehar hedatu daitezke, Compose pila bakarrera mugatu ordez. Berria *svc-swarm-node* klusterra hasieratzen du, baina *svc-swarm-manager* Rafteko kudeatzaileak inbentarioan markatzen ditu. Partekatutako egoera ematen da *svc-storage-nfs-server* eta *svc-storage-nfs-client*. *svc-registry-docker* Lokalki eraikitako irudiak banatzen ditu, eta *svc-registry-cache* Docker Hub-ek cachean tira egiten du, beraz, nodo gehigarriek ez dute kanpoko tirak eta tasa-muga erabilera biderkatzen. Hedapena, mendekotasunaren bereizmena, sarea, osasun-kontrolak eta rol-txantilak orain ulertzen dituzte bai Konposatua eta bai Swarm semantika. Ikusi [svc-swarm-node](roles/svc-swarm-node/README.md) eta [svc-storage-nfs-server](roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/README.md) Irakurriak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker Swarm deployment mode** for any role whose own Ansible group lists more than one host. The cluster is bootstrapped by the `svc-swarm-node` group; per-role topology is derived from `groups[application_id]` directly. A role with one or zero hosts in its group stays on the existing Compose path and renders byte-identical output (no implicit migration). Adding additional hosts to a role's own group is the single trigger that promotes the role to a Swarm service."
msgstr "**Docker Swarm inplementazio modua** Ansible talde batek ostalari bat baino gehiago zerrendatzen dituen edozein roltarako. Kumulua botata dago `svc-swarm-node` taldea; per-role topologiatik dator `groups[application_id]` Zuzenean. Taldean ostalari bat edo zero duen rol bat existitzen den Compose bide-izenean geratzen da eta byte-identical irteera ematen du. (migrazio inpliziturik ez). Rol-talde bati ostalari gehigarriak gehitzea da Swarm zerbitzu baten zeregina sustatzen duen abiarazle bakarra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
