# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Eligibility is read from LiteLLM's own catalog; a declaration is the override.** The image ships `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It never probes a backend at request time."
msgstr "**Aukera LiteLLM-en katalogotik irakurtzen da; adierazpen bat gainjartzea da.** Irudi-ontziak `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 modeloak sakon, garraiatuz `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` eta `input_cost_per_token`. Giltzak bide baten gaitasunak irakurtzen ditu. `litellm.model_cost`, bidean giltzaperatua `litellm_params.model` eta izen horretan bere lehen segmenturik gabe, zeren `ollama/llama3` aurrez aurre jartzen da `openai/gpt-4o-mini` honela aurkezten da: `gpt-4o-mini`. Inoiz ez du motorra probatzen eskatutako unean."

