# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embedded mode:** Roles that opt out of the shared instance run a private storage-only container inside their own compose network."
msgstr "**Modu kapsulatua:** Partekatutako instantziatik kanpo dauden rolek biltegi pribatua baino ez dute erabiltzen, beren konposaketa-sarearen barruan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embedded** (``enabled: true``, ``shared: false``): a Redis sidecar rendered into the consumer’s own compose stack via ``templates/service.yml.j2``."
msgstr "**Kapsulatua** (``enabled: true``, ``shared: false``): Redis-en albo-gurdi bat kontsumitzailearen konposaketa-pilara itzulia ``templates/service.yml.j2``."

