msgid "**Hash-chained audit:** Every tool call, webhook, instance event, channel message and routine run is appended to an insert-only audit chain (``utils.orchestrator.audit``); each entry binds the hash of the one before it, so a later edit or deletion breaks the chain and is detectable."
