# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Mitigazioa:** Irudiaren mailaren mutazioa (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) eta haien sinonimoak (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) oraindik bidea `ask`, Beraz, operadoreak haiek exekutatu aurretik aztertzen ditu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Mitigazioa:** Helburuak ezin dira gainditu `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, edo `deny` zerrenda. Asmo gaizto bat, alegia. `rm -rf .` geldiaraziko zuten. `rm -rf*` Ukatu araua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr "**Mitigazioa:** `docker run*` eta bere sinonimoak hemen daude `ask`, Beraz, operadoreak aztertzen ditu. (Jasokundearen gaia 5). The `deny` zerrenda-blokeak `sudo*`, hain zuzen ere pribilegioen eskalatze zuzena `sudo` Ez dago erabilgarri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Mitigazioa:** `sandbox.enabled: true` honekin: `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` motorra ez dagoenean hasten da. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` uko egiten dio `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tresna parametroa, beraz, ez dago dei bakoitzeko ihesik."

