# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that stay inside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, though builds still route through `ask`) just work under the sandbox."
msgstr "**Barruan geratzen diren aginduak mututzen `allowWrite`** (Adibidez: `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, nahiz eta oraindik bidea eraiki `ask`) sandbox azpian lan egin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that target paths outside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `mv ~/file /etc/`) fail at the sandbox layer with EROFS."
msgstr "**Komandoak lekuz aldatzea helburuko bideetatik kanpo `allowWrite`** (Adibidez: `mv ~/file /etc/`) huts egin du harea-ontziaren geruzan EROFSrekin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS for stateful databases.** v1 keeps DB data volumes local-only with node-pinning. Reconsidering this requires a separate requirement covering DB-specific NFS semantics (locking, fsync, version compatibility per engine)."
msgstr "**NFS datu-base estatutarrentzat.** v1 DB datu-bolumenak lokalki bakarrik mantentzen ditu nodo-pinningarekin. Honek beste baldintza bat eskatzen du DB-ren NFS semantika espezifikoa betetzeko. (blokeatu, fsync, bertsioaren bateragarritasuna motor bakoitzeko)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed shared volumes** so that the Swarm scheduler can move a container between nodes without losing volume state."
msgstr "**NFSk babestutako bolumen partekatuak** Swarm antolatzaileak nodoen artean edukiontzi bat mugi dezan bolumenaren egoera galdu gabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed storage:** ``docker_registry_data`` survives container/manager restarts when storage backend is NFS."
msgstr "**NFSren babespeko biltegia:** ``docker_registry_data`` edukiontzi-kudeatzailea berrabiarazten da biltegiratze-motorra NFS denean."

# translated-by: libretranslate
