# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned tool surface:** ``files/mcp/tools.json`` holds the 24 read-only tools captured from the sidecar, pinned twice: ``tools.schema_sha256`` over the parsed mapping the adapter rehashes at startup, and ``adapter.specification_sha256`` over the file bytes."
msgstr "**Pintatutako tresnaren azalera:** ``files/mcp/tools.json`` dauka 24 sidecar-etik ateratako tresnak bakarrik, bi aldiz itsatsiak: ``tools.schema_sha256`` abioko moldagailuaren mapa analizatuaren gainean, eta ``adapter.specification_sha256`` fitxategi-byteen gainean."

