msgid "**PostgreSQL 18 on the official image.** PGDG archived the Debian 11 repository that the old *postgis/postgis:17-3.5* base installed from, so every build of the shared database image failed. *svc-db-postgres* and the per-application database now run the official multi-arch *postgres:18* image, and the data volume mounts at */var/lib/postgresql*. Existing PostgreSQL 17 clusters are not migrated. Dump every database before you deploy this release and restore it into the new cluster afterwards. PostGIS is installed only for a role that declares it."
