msgid "**RBAC group mapping:** Map the Keycloak groups of the ``administrator``, ``manager``, ``publisher``, ``editor``, ``author`` and ``registered`` roles onto Joomla’s built-in ``Super Users``, ``Manager``, ``Publisher``, ``Editor``, ``Author`` and ``Registered`` user groups on every login."
