msgid "**RBAC policies:** One MinIO policy per RBAC group path (``administrator``, ``readwrite``, ``readonly``). OIDC logins pick them up through the groups claim, and the LDAP variant attaches each policy to its ``web-app-minio-<role>`` group under the roles OU."
