# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restore verified against real dumps.** The *recover* CLI replays a generation's database and cluster dumps, reads the generation's own layout instead of guessing it, and places each dump by the engine the backup observed rather than by name alone. The *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* drill now empties every volume it claims to test, fails on a database that was never dumped, and stops the backup timers before it goes destructive. Baudolo is pinned per host, its contract read from baudolo itself."
msgstr "**Berreskurapena benetako zabortegien aurka.** The *berreskuratu* CLIk belaunaldi baten datu-basea eta klusterren iraulketak erreproduzitzen ditu, sorkuntzaren diseinua irakurtzen du asmatu ordez, eta irauli bakoitza motorrean jartzen du behatutako babeskopia izenaren arabera bakarrik baino. The *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* zulagailuek huts egiten dute frogatu nahi duen bolumen oro, inoiz isuri ez den datu-base batean huts egiten du, eta babeskopiako denbora-tarteak geldiarazi egiten ditu suntsitzailea izan aurretik. Baudolo ostalariko da, baudolok berak idatzitako kontratua."

msgid "**Restricted SSO access:** With SSO enabled, ``security.oidc.auto_create_users`` stays off and `files/sql/rbac_reconcile.sql <./files/sql/rbac_reconcile.sql>`__ provisions Listmonk accounts only for the ``web-app-listmonk`` ``administrator`` (Super Admin), ``manager`` and ``viewer`` members, matched by email. The ``manager`` and ``viewer`` user roles are created with their permission sets from ``LISTMONK_RBAC_ROLES``. Every other account of type ``user`` is disabled, API accounts stay untouched, and the platform administrator stays Super Admin. The script runs through ``psql`` in the database container as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change reaches Listmonk within one timer interval."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted SSO access:** With SSO enabled, `security.oidc.auto_create_users` stays off and [files/sql/rbac_reconcile.sql](./files/sql/rbac_reconcile.sql) provisions Listmonk accounts only for the `web-app-listmonk` `administrator` (Super Admin), `manager` and `viewer` members, matched by email. The `manager` and `viewer` user roles are created with their permission sets from `LISTMONK_RBAC_ROLES`. Every other account of type `user` is disabled, API accounts stay untouched, and the platform administrator stays Super Admin. The script runs through `psql` in the database container as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change reaches Listmonk within one timer interval."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted Semaphore account:** the ``app-control`` user signs in only with the public half of the ``app_control_ssh_key`` credential of ``web-app-semaphore``. A forced command accepts ``app-control stop|start <application_id>|all`` and nothing else, and sudo lets the account run exactly those two subcommands as root."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted Semaphore account:** the `app-control` user signs in only with the public half of the `app_control_ssh_key` credential of `web-app-semaphore`. A forced command accepts `app-control stop|start <application_id>|all` and nothing else, and sudo lets the account run exactly those two subcommands as root."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted access:** The oauth2-proxy admits only members of the ``administrator`` and ``user`` role groups (``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` in ``meta/services.yml``). The LDAP filter of Snipe-IT admits the same two groups and leaves out the bootstrap administrator, which keeps its local password."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted access:** The oauth2-proxy admits only members of the ``administrator`` and ``user`` role groups."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted access:** The oauth2-proxy admits only members of the `administrator` and `user` role groups (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml`). The LDAP filter of Snipe-IT admits the same two groups and leaves out the bootstrap administrator, which keeps its local password."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted access:** The oauth2-proxy admits only members of the `administrator` and `user` role groups."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted access:** ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` in ``meta/services.yml`` admits only members of the ``web-app-n8n`` ``administrator`` and ``mcp`` RBAC groups. Every other Keycloak user, biber included, is refused by oauth2-proxy with a 403. n8n Community Edition offers no group-to-role mapping, so every admitted user except the owner (``users.administrator.email``) is provisioned as ``global:member``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted access:** `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only members of the `web-app-n8n` `administrator` and `mcp` RBAC groups. Every other Keycloak user, biber included, is refused by oauth2-proxy with a 403. n8n Community Edition offers no group-to-role mapping, so every admitted user except the owner (`users.administrator.email`) is provisioned as `global:member`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with ``network_mode: none`` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: ``volumes/create`` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Motorraren sarbide murriztua:** Agentea edukiontzi-motorrera bakarrik iristen da socket proxy-arekin partekatutako bolumen batean iragazitako unix socket baten bidez, porturik argitaratzen ez duena eta exekutatzen duena. ``network_mode: none`` konposatuan. Proxy-ak edukiontzia, zerbitzua, ataza, sarea, bolumena eta irudia bakarrik onartzen ditu eta beste metodo eta bide guztiak baztertzen ditu, exekuzioak eta ezabatzea barne. Metodoak eta bideak iragazten ditu, ez gorputzak eskatzen: ``volumes/create`` Beraz, isolamendua agente konprometitu baten aurka dago, eta horrek ez du inolako entxuferik lortzen, ez bitartekari konprometitu baten aurka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Restricted engine access:** The broker reaches the container engine only through a filtered unix socket in a volume shared with the socket proxy, which publishes no port and runs with `network_mode: none` in compose. The proxy admits only the container, service, task, network, volume and image calls the broker makes, and refuses every other method and path, including exec and delete. It filters methods and paths, not request bodies: `volumes/create` stays open for the per-agent volume, so the isolation holds against a compromised agent, which reaches no socket at all, not against a compromised broker."
msgstr "**Motorraren sarbide murriztua:** Agentea edukiontzi-motorrera bakarrik iristen da socket proxy-arekin partekatutako bolumen batean iragazitako unix socket baten bidez, porturik argitaratzen ez duena eta exekutatzen duena. `network_mode: none` konposatuan. Proxy-ak edukiontzia, zerbitzua, ataza, sarea, bolumena eta irudia bakarrik onartzen ditu eta beste metodo eta bide guztiak baztertzen ditu, exekuzioak eta ezabatzea barne. Metodoak eta bideak iragazten ditu, ez gorputzak eskatzen: `volumes/create` Beraz, isolamendua agente konprometitu baten aurka dago, eta horrek ez du inolako entxuferik lortzen, ez bitartekari konprometitu baten aurka."

msgid "**Restricted project:** ``agents-<instance>`` allows unprivileged instances only, pool-managed disks only (no host path), managed network cards on the agent bridge only and no low-level VM options."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Restricted project:** `agents-<instance>` allows unprivileged instances only, pool-managed disks only (no host path), managed network cards on the agent bridge only and no low-level VM options."
