msgid "**Role-Restricted SAML Sign-In:** ```files/php/iam/saml_directory_sync.php`` <./files/php/iam/saml_directory_sync.php>`__, mounted as the ``Iam`` extension, refuses an assertion whose ``groups`` attribute names neither the ``administrator`` nor the ``user`` role group before SuiteCRM creates an account, and clears the admin flag of the refused account; the platform administrator passes without a group."
