msgid "**Safe Defaults:** Best-effort cleanup without breaking running services."
msgstr "**Lehenetsi seguruak:** Garbiketarik onena, zerbitzua hautsi gabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Safe Execution:** Includes validation for missing services and Docker availability."
msgstr "**Exekuzio segurua:** Zerbitzu faltaren balidazioa eta Dockerren erabilgarritasuna barne hartzen ditu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Safe with untrusted forks:** Trees are read as data only (safe YAML, Babel catalogs); refs and paths are validated before git sees them."
msgstr "**Seguru sardexka ez-fidagarriekin:** Zuhaitzak datu gisa soilik irakurtzen dira (YAML segurua, Babel katalogoak); Errefak eta bideak balioztatu egiten dira git-ek ikusi aurretik."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sales & Service CRM:** Accounts, Contacts, Leads, Opportunities, Cases, Campaigns and more 📊"
msgstr "**Salmenta eta Zerbitzu CRM:** Kontuak, kontaktuak, liderrak, aukerak, kasuak, kanpainak eta gehiago 📊"

msgid "**Same contract.** `POST /v1/systemone` as the gateway speaks it, plus the `GET /health` the backend already serves."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Same contract.** ``POST /v1/systemone`` as the gateway speaks it, plus the ``GET /health`` the backend already serves."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Same-origin path:** Every front-proxy vhost also serves the CDN tree under `/_infinito/cdn/`; `lookup('cdn', ...)` and `lookup('design', ...)` return those host-relative URLs as `relative_urls`, so a page served on any network loads its assets from its own host."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Same-origin path:** Every front-proxy vhost also serves the CDN tree under ``/_infinito/cdn/``; ``lookup('cdn', ...)`` and ``lookup('design', ...)`` return those host-relative URLs as ``relative_urls``, so a page served on any network loads its assets from its own host."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Sampling is the exception, answering is the rule.** The gateway fans out only when the sampler is due, and once a signature has accumulated a clear leader over a configured number of comparisons it routes straight to that engine without asking the decider at all. That is what makes the log pay for itself. A configured re-sample rate keeps a signature from freezing on a verdict the engines have since outgrown."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Sandbox** (precedence 3): everything else runs under `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Writes outside `allowWrite` fail with `EROFS`; reads from the default `~/.ssh` private keys, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, etc. are denied; outbound connections to anything not in `allowedDomains` fail."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Saved server passwords:** OAuth2 accounts keep no pgAdmin password, so pgAdmin asks them for a master password before it stores a server password (`MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Saved server passwords:** OAuth2 accounts keep no pgAdmin password, so pgAdmin asks them for a master password before it stores a server password (``MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED``)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalability and Performance:** Efficiently manage video transcoding, live streaming, and storage through containerized microservices."
msgstr "**Eskalagarritasuna eta errendimendua:** Kudeatu bideo transkodetzea, zuzeneko streaminga eta biltegiratzea edukiontzidun mikrozerbitzuen bidez."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Benefit from a multi-service, Docker-based setup that supports high user loads and seamless background processing."
msgstr "**Arkitektura eskalagarria:** Docker-en oinarritutako konfigurazioaren mesedea, erabiltzailearen karga altuak eta atzeko planoaren prozesamendua onartzen dituena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Designed to handle increasing user loads and message volumes with high performance."
msgstr "**Arkitektura eskalagarria:** Erabiltzailearen karga eta mezu-bolumen handiagoak kudeatzeko diseinatua, errendimendu handikoak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Efficiently handle increasing workloads while maintaining high performance."
msgstr "**Arkitektura eskalagarria:** Lan kargak eraginkortasunez kudeatzea, errendimendu handia mantenduz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Utilize a Docker-based deployment that adapts easily to increasing traffic and community size."
msgstr "**Arkitektura eskalagarria:** Docker-en oinarritutako hedapena erabiltzea, trafikoa eta komunitatearen tamaina handitzeko erraz egokitzen dena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Leverage Docker for a portable and scalable installation that adapts as your user base grows."
msgstr "**Eskalako hedapena:** Leverage Docker instalazio eramangarri eta eskalagarri baterako, zure erabiltzaile-oinarria hazi ahala egokitzen dena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your analytics platform can grow with your traffic demands."
msgstr "**Eskalako hedapena:** Erabili Docker zure analitika-plataforma zure trafiko-beharrekin hazi dadin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your event platform grows seamlessly with your community’s needs."
msgstr "**Eskalako hedapena:** Erabili Docker zure gertaera-plataformak zure komunitatearen beharrak asetzen dituela bermatzeko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Utilize Docker for a portable and scalable setup that adapts as your community grows."
msgstr "**Eskalako hedapena:** Erabili Docker konfigurazio eramangarri eta eskalagarri baterako, zure komunitatea hazten den heinean."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Service Architecture:** Leverage the robust orchestration of multiple services to power your Funkwhale instance."
msgstr "**Zerbitzuen arkitektura eskalagarria:** Erabili zerbitzu anitzen orkestrazio sendoa Funkwhale-ren instantziari ekiteko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable and Customizable:** Easily tailor settings and scale your Keycloak instance to meet growing demands."
