# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On:** Frontend and controller share one Keycloak client and realm."
msgstr "**Sinatzeko bakarra:** Frontend eta kontroladoreak Keycloak bezero eta erresuma bat partekatzen dute."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single Sign-On:** Users authenticate once via Keycloak and reuse the session across the platform."
msgstr "**Sinatzeko bakarra:** Erabiltzaileak Keycloak-en bidez autentifikatzen dira behin eta berriro saioa plataforman zehar berrerabiliz."

msgid "**Single Sign-On:** With Keycloak deployed, the login page offers a Keycloak sign-in through the GPL-3.0 [RebelOIDC](https://github.com/Digitalist-Open-Cloud/Matomo-Plugin-RebelOIDC) plugin, which the custom image ships and the deploy activates. The OIDC username claim names the Matomo login, an existing account with that login is linked on first sign-in, and the sign-out also ends the Keycloak session. Signup is off, so only accounts the deploy provisioned can sign in. The local superuser keeps its password login behind the break-glass URL."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single Sign-On:** With Keycloak deployed, the login page offers a Keycloak sign-in through the GPL-3.0 `RebelOIDC <https://github.com/Digitalist-Open-Cloud/Matomo-Plugin-RebelOIDC>`__ plugin, which the custom image ships and the deploy activates. The OIDC username claim names the Matomo login, an existing account with that login is linked on first sign-in, and the sign-out also ends the Keycloak session. Signup is off, so only accounts the deploy provisioned can sign in. The local superuser keeps its password login behind the break-glass URL."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**Gako bakarra, aplikazio bakoitzeko azpidomeinuak:** ezkutuko zerbitzu batek aplikazio guztietan balio du `<app>.<node>.onion`, OpenRestyk gidatzen du."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at ``<app>.<node>.onion``, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**Gako bakarra, aplikazio bakoitzeko azpidomeinuak:** ezkutuko zerbitzu batek aplikazio guztietan balio du ``<app>.<node>.onion``, OpenRestyk gidatzen du."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single logic for all roles**"
msgstr "**Rol guztietarako logika bakarra**"

msgid "**Single point of truth:** ``email.provider`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ selects the provider; ``MAIL_PROVIDER`` and the ``mail_provider`` and ``email`` lookups derive from it."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single point of truth:** `email.provider` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) selects the provider; `MAIL_PROVIDER` and the `mail_provider` and `email` lookups derive from it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single points of truth, enforced by lint.** The new *sys-lint* role pins the GitHub-release lint tools. Every mount target has one spot in *meta/volumes.yml* and container paths are derived from it, *default.env* is the enforced source of the primary domain, *container_backup* is rejected where no volume exists, and role credentials live at *meta/secrets.yml*. Linters no longer read gitignored build output, comments are checked in every file rather than only changed ones, and every shipped script requires a mirrored unit test."
msgstr "**Egiaren puntu bakarrak, lintek beteak.** Berria *sys-lint* Rolak GitHub-en lint-tresnak betetzen ditu. Muntaiaren helburu bakoitzak puntu bat du *meta/volumes.yml* eta edukiontzien bideak hortik datoz, *default.env* domeinu nagusiaren iturburu betearazlea da, *container_backup* ukatu egiten da bolumenik ez dagoen tokian eta rol-kredentzialak bizi diren lekuan *meta/secrets.yml*. Linters-ek ez du jadanik gitignored build output irakurtzen, iruzkinak fitxategi guztietan egiaztatzen dira aldatu ordez, eta bidalitako script bakoitzak ispiludun unitate proba bat behar du."

msgid "**Single run per cluster:** in swarm the timer only uses the container of task slot 1."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single sign-on across protocols and domains.** Keycloak imports a SAML client for every app that asks for one; SuiteCRM authenticates against it via SAML instead of a proxy, and Shopware provisions its admin through AdminOpenAuth with the front and back channel split. Sessions are shared across app domains, the issuer is pinned to the canonical OIDC URL, each consumer's redirect scheme resolves on its own side, and the logout sweep runs where the visitor is looking. Directory users are read through one lookup so seeding cannot diverge."
msgstr "**Sinadura bakarra protokolo eta domeinuetan zehar.** Keycloak SAML bezero bat inportatzen du bat eskatzen duen aplikazio bakoitzeko; SuiteCRM-ek SAML bidez autentifikatzen du proxy-aren ordez, eta Shopware-k bere administratzailea hornitzen du AdminOpenAuthen bidez, aurreko eta atzeko kanalen zatiketarekin. Saioak aplikazio-domeinuetan zehar banatzen dira, jaulkitzailea OIDC URL kanonikoarekin lotuta dago, kontsumitzaile bakoitzaren birbideratze-eskemak bere alde egiten du, eta bisitaria begira dagoen lekutik ateratzen da. Direktorio-erabiltzaileak bilaketa baten bidez irakurtzen dira, beraz ezin da diferentziatu."

msgid "**Single sign-on through the proxy header:** with the oauth2-proxy gate active, ``files/shell/ldap/bootstrap.sh`` sets ``fdLoginMethod: LoginHTTPHeader`` and reads the user name from the ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`` header that the vhost always overwrites from the oauth2-proxy identity. Without the gate it sets ``LoginPost``, so FusionDirectory shows its own login form. Both values are reconciled on every deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on through the proxy header:** with the oauth2-proxy gate active, `files/shell/ldap/bootstrap.sh` sets `fdLoginMethod: LoginHTTPHeader` and reads the user name from the `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header that the vhost always overwrites from the oauth2-proxy identity. Without the gate it sets `LoginPost`, so FusionDirectory shows its own login form. Both values are reconciled on every deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the editor and admits only members of the administrator and agent-user groups of this application."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the gateway and admits only members of the ``administrator`` and ``mcp`` role groups of this application (``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` in ``meta/services.yml``). Every other Keycloak user, biber included, gets a 403 from the proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the gateway and admits only members of the `administrator` and `mcp` role groups of this application (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml`). Every other Keycloak user, biber included, gets a 403 from the proxy."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-Site path**: the claim MUST contain `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` entries. The highest-privilege role across all matches wins (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). When no entry matches, the user's role is set to `subscriber` as a deterministic fallback."
msgstr "**Bide bakarra**: Erreklamazioak eduki behar du `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` sarrerak. Maila goreneko rolak partida guztietan irabazten du (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). Sarrera bat ez datorrenean, erabiltzailearen rola ezarrita dago `subscriber` Atzerapen determinista gisa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-container deployment** via Docker Compose."
msgstr "**Konexio bakarreko hedapena** Docker Compose bidez."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-manager bootstrap:** Initialises the cluster on the manager with the configured advertise address; idempotent on re-runs."
msgstr "**Kudeatzaile bakarreko bota-trapa:** Kudeatzailearen klusterra abiarazten du konfiguratutako iragarki-helbidearekin; idempotent berriz exekutatzen."

msgid "**Single-node Wazuh stack:** Manager, indexer, and dashboard at the versions pinned in [services.yml](./meta/services.yml)."
msgstr ""

