# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single-owner model:** One privileged identity, gated by ``req.session.loggedIn``."
msgstr "**Jabe bakarreko modeloa:** Nortasun pribilegiatu bat, nork makurtua ``req.session.loggedIn``."

