msgid "**`allowed_consumers` creates no network edge.** A client reaches a provider only when the provider declares a `kind: mcp_client` consumer in `meta/networks.yml`, or when the client happens to declare that provider for an unrelated reason. Four of twenty providers declared the opening; the other sixteen admitted consumers they could not serve, four of them enabled. Deploying Hermes failed at its own probe with `All connection attempts failed` against `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, because `hermes` joins `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` while `prometheusmcp` joins `[prometheus]` alone."
msgstr "**`allowed_consumers` Ez du sareko ertzik sortzen.** Bezero bat hornitzailearengana soilik iristen da hornitzaileak adierazten duenean `kind: mcp_client` kontsumitzailea `meta/networks.yml`, edo bezeroak hornitzaile hori beste arrazoi batengatik deklaratzen duenean. Hogeita lau hornitzailek deklaratu zuten inaugurazioa; beste hamaseiek ezin izan zuten zerbitzatu, haietako lau gaituta. Hermesek huts egin zuen bere zundan. `All connection attempts failed` aurka `http://prometheusmcp:8080/mcp`, zeren eta `hermes` elkartu `[gitlab, hermes, homeassistant, litellm, moodle]` bitartean `prometheusmcp` elkartu `[prometheus]` Bakarrik."

