msgid "A human developer reconfigures any role the way applications are reconfigured: the inventory's `agents.<role>` is deep-merged over the role's `agent.yml` and `cron.yml`, and every consumer reads the merged result through one lookup (`lookup('agent_config', role, path)`), never the raw files."
