msgid "A stopped agent is started again on the next request with its volume re-attached. An agent serving a request is never stopped, and the idle time is re-read under the agent's lock before the stop. When a caller has lost the `agent-user` group, the broker refuses the request and stops that caller's running agent."
msgstr "Gelditutako agente bat berriro abiaraziko da hurrengo eskaeran bere bolumena berriro sartuta. Eskaera egiten duen agente bat ez da inoiz gelditzen, eta denbora nagia agentearen sarrailaren azpian irakurtzen da gelditu aurretik. Deilari batek galtzen duenean `agent-user` Taldea, bitartekariak eskaerari uko egiten dio eta dei-egilearen agenteari gelditzen dio."

