# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both flavors cap the state and the option count and answer HTTP 422 above them, so the gateway truncates the prompt to ``services.litellm.router.state_chars`` before asking. The ``laya`` flavor shares a fixed token budget across the options of one question, so accuracy falls off well before its own cap; the deployments here put a handful of model aliases to it, far below where that matters."
msgstr "Bi zaporeek egoera eta aukera zenbatu eta HTTPri erantzuten diote 422 haien gainean, ate-ateak gonbitea ezkutatzen du. ``services.litellm.router.state_chars`` galdetu aurretik. The ``laya`` Zaporeak token-aurrekontu finkoa partekatzen du galdera baten aukeren artean, beraz, zehaztasuna ongi erortzen da bere kapa baino lehen; hedapenek eredu-alias sorta bat jartzen diote, horren azpian."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both flavors cap the state and the option count and answer HTTP 422 above them, so the gateway truncates the prompt to `services.litellm.router.state_chars` before asking. The `laya` flavor shares a fixed token budget across the options of one question, so accuracy falls off well before its own cap; the deployments here put a handful of model aliases to it, far below where that matters."
msgstr "Bi zaporeek egoera eta aukera zenbatu eta HTTPri erantzuten diote 422 haien gainean, ate-ateak gonbitea ezkutatzen du. `services.litellm.router.state_chars` galdetu aurretik. The `laya` Zaporeak token-aurrekontu finkoa partekatzen du galdera baten aukeren artean, beraz, zehaztasuna ongi erortzen da bere kapa baino lehen; hedapenek eredu-alias sorta bat jartzen diote, horren azpian."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both halves are required: ``tor.enabled`` is the dependency edge, not the port forward, so a client picking the Tor transport from that flag alone dials a port with no HiddenServicePort and no host publish."
msgstr "Bi zatiak behar dira: ``tor.enabled`` mendekotasun-muga da, ez aurrerako ataka, beraz, bezero batek Tor-en garraioa bandera horretatik bakarrik markatzen du portu bat, HiddenServicePort gabe eta ostalaririk gabe."

msgid "Both halves may come through other names. A bare local port number, as ``LDAP.SERVER.PORT``, is left out, because containers pair it with a service name; so are the vhost inputs (``http_port`` and its siblings), which openresty hands to ``proxy_pass`` and swarm ignores, and every value that hands one to the vhost."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both helpers degrade gracefully:"
msgstr "Bi laguntzaileek graziaz degradatzen dira:"

msgid "Both hold an exclusive lock under the work directory, so two of them on one checkout never interleave, and clear what an interrupted run left there. They swap entries by rename and delete the old copies only after the swap, so an interrupt never leaves a declared role missing."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, which targets the ``openid-connect/auth`` href explicitly, opens ``/admin``, and signs out at ``/admin/ui/logout``; a second scenario drives the biber-to-administrator mail round-trip across two browser contexts. The path back to the generic personas is a distinguishable login control on Mailu’s SSO page."
msgstr "Bi bidaiak neurrira estalita daude ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, helburu duena ``openid-connect/auth`` href esplizituki, ireki ``/admin``, eta seinaleak agertzen dira ``/admin/ui/logout``; bigarren agertoki batek biber-to-administrator-en posta biribila gidatzen du arakatzailearen bi testuingurutan zehar. Pertsona orokorren bide-izena Mailu-ren SSO orrian saio-hasierako kontrol bereizgarria da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: the master-realm super administrator drives the admin console, and the normal-realm administrator and biber each drive the realm account console including sign-out. The path back to the generic personas is an app-shaped surface behind the shared auth chain, which the identity provider by definition does not have."
msgstr "Bi bidaiak neurrira estalita daude ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: master-realm superadministratzaileak administratzailearen kontsola gidatzen du, eta administratzaile normalak eta biber bakoitzak erresumako kontu-kontsola barne. Pertsona generikoetarako bidea auth kate partekatuaren atzean dagoen aplikazio-formako azalera da, definizioz identitate-hornitzaileak ez duena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which targets the `openid-connect/auth` href explicitly, opens `/admin`, and signs out at `/admin/ui/logout`; a second scenario drives the biber-to-administrator mail round-trip across two browser contexts. The path back to the generic personas is a distinguishable login control on Mailu's SSO page."
msgstr "Bi bidaiak neurrira estalita daude `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, helburu duena `openid-connect/auth` href esplizituki, ireki `/admin`, eta seinaleak agertzen dira `/admin/ui/logout`; bigarren agertoki batek biber-to-administrator-en posta biribila gidatzen du arakatzailearen bi testuingurutan zehar. Pertsona orokorren bide-izena Mailu-ren SSO orrian saio-hasierako kontrol bereizgarria da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: the master-realm super administrator drives the admin console, and the normal-realm administrator and biber each drive the realm account console including sign-out. The path back to the generic personas is an app-shaped surface behind the shared auth chain, which the identity provider by definition does not have."
