msgid "Compose loop routine: iterate on a local compose deploy of one or more roles. The role's own unit and fixture tests run before any deploy; an ask step proposes disabling non-essential providers; deterministic steps run make compose-deploy around make test; one model step reaches confidence in-container before the hard verified-in-container gate. The relevant-delta decision skips a redeploy when nothing changed since the last run; every redeploy starts with make test, so every changed path counts. A decision node picks the redeploy from the diff: a fix inside the app role takes make compose-role-sync, which reaches the role's first task without the constructor, system and provider stages; a file the inventory bakes in takes a reinstall, because mode=update reuses the inventory; every other fix takes mode=update. Every red or still-running redeploy passes the red chain (watchdog, reached check, signature stop rule) before the loop inspects it again. Every path to done runs an update pass and then the reinstall final gate: a role sync or a plain fix through the mode=update redeploy, a reinstall through its own full_cycle pass."
