# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Daniel Kahneman's split names the shape. The models behind the gateway are System II: slow, general, token-generating. What is missing is System I: fast, typed, no generation, deciding which System II model answers. TypeSafe released [Jev](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jev_(AI_model)) on 2026-09-15 as a model of exactly that kind, and [jev-router](https://github.com/prismhq/jev-router) wires one into LiteLLM as a pre-call hook. This requirement takes that shape and keeps the decision deterministic; decision 8 records why."
msgstr "Daniel Kahnemanen izen banaketak forma du. Atebidearen atzeko modeloak II sistema dira: motela, orokorra, token-generatzailea. I. Sistema falta da: azkarra, idatzia, belaunaldirik gabea, zein sistemari erantzuten dion erabakitzeko. TypeSafe askatuta [Jev](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jev_(AI_model)) - 2026-09-15 horrelako eredu bat bezala, eta [jev-router](https://github.com/prismhq/jev-router) bat LiteLLM-n jartzen du, aurrez dei egiteko gako gisa. Baldintza horrek forma hori hartzen du eta erabakiak determinista izaten du; erabakia 8 Grabatu zergatik."

