# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Files produced by the containerized runner (e.g. `__pycache__/*.pyc` under [`tests/`](tests/), build artefacts) are often owned by `nobody` or another in-container UID and cannot be removed from the host. When a host-level `rm`/`chmod`/edit fails with `Permission denied` on such paths, agents MUST run the cleanup via `make compose-exec` (see [compose.yml](compose.yml); the repo is mounted at `/opt/src/infinito`) and MUST NOT ask the operator which path to take."
msgstr "Edukiontzidun korrikalariak sortutako fitxategiak (Adibidez: `__pycache__/*.pyc` azpian [`tests/`](tests/), eraikitzeko artefaktuak) sarritan jabea da `nobody` Edo beste UID bat eta ezin da ostalaritik kendu. Ostalari maila bat denean `rm`/`chmod`/edit-ek huts egiten du `Permission denied` bide horietan, agenteek garbiketa egin behar dute. `make compose-exec` (Ikusi [compose.yml](compose.yml); repoa hemen muntatuta dago `/opt/src/infinito`) Ez galdetu operadoreari zein bide hartu behar duen."

