# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish mirror packages directly, so their runs wait for the `pull_request_target` mirror producer before continuing. The producer mirrors with the Docker Hub credentials only for trusted PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); untrusted forks mirror anonymously (no organization secrets). See [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for the mirroring architecture and naming convention."
msgstr "Fork PRs-ek ezin ditu ispilu-paketeak zuzenean argitaratu, beraz, itxaron egiten dute. `pull_request_target` Ispilu ekoizlea jarraitu aurretik. Ekoizleak Docker Hub-en kredentzialekin ispiluak egiten ditu PR fidagarrientzat bakarrik. ([🛡️ Fidatua](#trusted-fork-prs-)); sardexkarik gabeko ispilua anonimoki (erakunde sekreturik ez). [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) arkitekturaren ispilurako eta izendatzeko konbentziorako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish packages themselves, so their untrusted `pull_request` runs wait in `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` until a trusted producer run has published the required refs."
msgstr "Fork PRek ezin ditu paketeak argitaratu, beraz, ez dira fidagarriak. `pull_request` zain daude `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` ekoizle fidagarri batek beharrezko errefrakzioa argitaratu arte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs run under the `pull_request` event without write permissions. Privileged steps (image builds, package writes) run via `pull_request_target`. The fork CI waits for those privileged images before proceeding. See [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) for the contributor-facing fork workflow."
msgstr "Sardexka-prezioak korrika doaz azpira `pull_request` Gertaera idazteko baimenik gabe. Urrats pribilegiatuak (irudiak eraiki, paketeak idazten du) exekutatu `pull_request_target`. CI sardexka irudi pribilegiatu horien zain dago jarraitu aurretik. Ikusi [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) sardexkaren lan-fluxuari laguntzeko."

