msgid "In swarm, OpenLDAP publishes no port. Its overlay declares ``stream_relay`` in ``meta/networks.yml``, so openresty and OpenLDAP share the network ``openldap-relay`` on its pinned subnet and no other role joins it. Openresty publishes 636 in host mode on its node and relays to ``openldap:<ports.internal.ldap>``, which the resolver of ``stream{}`` looks up per connection. The relay leaves the openldap overlay and the trusted proxy addresses of the LDAP clients as they are."
