# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for Ansible-native artefacts: action plugins, filter plugins, lookup plugins, handlers, group_vars, inventory, Jinja templates, playbooks, and role-local [`vars/`](vars/) / `defaults/`."
msgstr "Ansible-native artefaktuetarako integrazio-probak: ekintza-pluginak, iragazki-pluginak, bilaketa-pluginak, kudeatzaileak, group_vars, inbentarioa, Jinja txantiloiak, jolas-liburuak eta paper-tokia [`vars/`](vars/) / `defaults/`."

msgid "Integration tests for `.github/workflows/*.yml` and supporting scripts: PR scope/branch-prefix resolvers, PR-run cancellation, Dependabot coverage of every ecosystem in the repo, CodeQL security-workflow coverage, and the commit subject behind every release tag."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for `.j2` templates across the repository: syntax validity, include-path resolution, and consistent variable definition and usage."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak `.j2` Txantiloiak biltegian zehar: sintaxiaren baliozkotasuna, bideen bereizmena eta definizio aldakor eta erabilera iraunkorra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for `utils/manager/inventory/InventoryManager` and related inventory-schema machinery: transitive provider-role resolution, schema apply, vault scalar round-trip."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak `utils/manager/inventory/InventoryManager` eta erlazionatutako inbentario-eskemako makineria: hornitzaile-errendimendu iragankorra, eskema aplikatua, ganga-eskala biribila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for block-level `when:` hygiene across `roles/*/tasks/**`: max-three-task guard blocks, no duplicated when-conditions across tasks, and the pure-guarded-include pattern for role inclusion."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak bloke-mailan `when:` higienea alde guztietan `roles/*/tasks/**`: hiru ataza-bloke, ez bikoiztutako baldintzak atazetan zehar, eta zaindutako eredua rol-inklusiorako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for cross-cutting metadata that describes the project itself: role categories, CLI entrypoints, domain declarations, and GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot)."
msgstr "Proiektua bera deskribatzen duten metadatuen integrazio-probak: rol-kategoriak, CLI sarrera-puntuak, domeinu-adierazpenak eta GitHub-side CI/CD artefaktuak (lan-fluxuak, Dependabot)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for cross-role variable and defaults hygiene: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` uniqueness across `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, and `group_vars/**`; and the prohibition against overriding Ansible facts via `vars:` or `set_fact:`."
msgstr "Aldagai gurutzatuaren eta higiene lehenetsiaren integrazio-probak: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` apartekotasuna `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, eta `group_vars/**`; eta egitate ansibleak gainditzearen debekuaren bidez `vars:` edo `set_fact:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for custom Jinja filter plugins under `plugins/filter/` and `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: every filter referenced in templates MUST be defined, and filters MUST behave correctly end-to-end (e.g. `strong_password`, `dotenv_quote`)."
msgstr "Jinja iragazki pertsonalizatuen pluginen integrazio-probak `plugins/filter/` eta `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: Txantiloietan erreferentziatutako iragazki guztiak definitu behar dira, eta iragazkiek zuzen jokatu behar dute amaieratik bukaeraraino. (Adibidez: `strong_password`, `dotenv_quote`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for identity and access surfaces: OAuth2 / OIDC configuration invariants (mutual exclusion, ACL shape, proxy port allocation, RBAC group-path declarations) and password / secret quoting rules."
msgstr "Nortasunaren eta sarbide-azalen integrazio-probak: OAuth2 / OIDC konfigurazioa aldaezinak (elkarrekiko bazterketa, ACL forma, proxy atakaren esleipena, RBAC talde-bidearen aitorpena) eta pasahitza eta isileko arauak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for playbook-level wiring: `tasks/stages/**`, invokable-path coverage, and the dispatch between them."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak liburu-mailako kableatzeko: `tasks/stages/**`, Bide-babesa eta haien arteko bidalketa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `cli/` package: subcommand discovery and `--help` smoke tests for every invokable CLI entrypoint."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak `cli/` paketea: komandoaren aurkikuntza eta `--help` ke-probak CLI sarrera-puntu ezeztagarri bakoitzerako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `run_once_<role_name>` fact pattern: flag suffixes MUST match their role folder name, flags MUST be defined before use, and inclusion of `utils/once/flag.yml` MUST follow the schema."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak `run_once_<role_name>` egitate-eredua: bandera-atzizkiek bat egin behar dute karpeta-izenarekin, banderak definitu behar dira erabili aurretik, eta txertatu. `utils/once/flag.yml` Eskemari jarraitu behar zaio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the custom Ansible lookup plugins under `plugins/lookup/`: config-path validation against role schemas and runtime caching performance."
msgstr "Bilaketarako plugin pertsonalizatuetarako integrazio-probak `plugins/lookup/`: konfigurazio-bidearen balidazioa rol-eskemaren eta exekuzio-denboraren cache-aren errendimenduaren aurka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the deployment substrate that every role shares: Docker Compose templates, Docker image consistency, container networks, the shared service registry, and the backups contract."
msgstr "Docker Compose txantiloiak, Docker irudiaren koherentzia, edukiontzi-sareak, zerbitzu-erregistro partekatua eta babes-kopiak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce contracts between tasks and handlers. One file per contract, no second opinion on the same rule:"
msgstr "Zereginen eta kudeatzaileen arteko kontratuak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak. Fitxategi bat kontratu bakoitzeko, ez dago bigarren iritzirik arau berari buruz:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce every `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target referenced from role tasks (and other project YAML) resolves to an existing file."
msgstr "Bakoitza behartzen duten integrazio-probak `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` zereginetatik erreferentziatutako helburua (eta beste proiektu bat YAML) Existitzen den fitxategi batera zuzentzen da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of `galaxy_info.run_after` in each role's `meta/main.yml`: every referenced name MUST resolve to an existing role directory, no role MUST list itself in `run_after`, and the resulting ordering graph MUST be acyclic."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak aldaezinak ezartzen dituztenak `galaxy_info.run_after` rol bakoitzean `meta/main.yml`: erreferentziatutako izen bakoitzak existitzen den funtzio-direktorio bat ebatzi behar du, ez du paperik zerrendatu behar. `run_after`, eta lortutako ordenaren grafikoak ziklikoak izan behar du."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/main.yml`: the file MUST exist for every role under `roles/`, and `galaxy_info` MUST carry the fields the Sphinx generator expects (non-empty `description`, no `None` values)."
msgstr "Rol bakoitzaren aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak `meta/main.yml`: fitxategia egon behar da rol bakoitzerako `roles/`, eta `galaxy_info` Sphinx sorgailuak espero dituen eremuak eraman behar ditu (hutsik ez `description`, Ez, ez. `None` balioak)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/services.yml`: the dynamic-flag form (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) MUST be used wherever a service entry depends on a sibling role's deployment, and a role's `services.yml` MUST NOT reference itself as a sibling provider."
msgstr "Rol bakoitzaren aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak `meta/services.yml`: forma dinamikoa (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) Zerbitzu-sarrera bat rol baten hedapenaren mende dagoen lekuan erabili behar da, eta rol baten garapenean. `services.yml` Ez du bere burua hornitzaile gisa aipatu behar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/variants.yml`: the matrix-deploy variant list MUST exercise every dynamic flag declared in the role's `meta/services.yml` on both polarities, every service key referenced under `services:` in a variant MUST exist in `services.yml`, and the auth matrix (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) MUST cover the LDAP-only branch."
msgstr "Rol bakoitzaren aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak `meta/variants.yml`: matrize-deploy aldaeren zerrendak paperaren bandera dinamiko guztiak erabili behar ditu. `meta/services.yml` polaritate bietan, zerbitzu-gako bakoitza, azpian erreferentziatuta `services:` aldaki batean existitu behar da `services.yml`, eta auth matrizea (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) LDAPeko adar bakarra estali behar da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of repository declarations in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: every `git clone`-style URL referenced from a role MUST be declared as an entity with a `repository:` key, and any entity that declares `repository:` MUST also pin a `ref:`."
msgstr "Biltegi-adierazpenen aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: `git clone`- rol batetik erreferentziatutako URLa entitate gisa deklaratu behar da. `repository:` gakoa eta adierazten duen edozein entitate `repository:` A ere itsatsi behar da `ref:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the `server:` block in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Content-Security-Policy structure (whitelist / flags / hashes), supported directives, valid URL / Jinja / wildcard entries."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak, aldaezinak ezartzen dituztenak `server:` blokea `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Edukiaren segurtasunaren egitura (zerrenda zuria / banderak / hasheak), onartutako direktibak, baliozko URLak / Jinja / komodinak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the prometheus integration: every web-app/svc role declares the shared `prometheus` service entry, the prometheus role's own nginx + docker-health wiring is intact, and the native-metrics scrape contract (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` ⇔ `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) holds across the roles tree."
msgstr "Prometeoaren integrazioaren aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak: web-aplikazio/svc rol orok adierazten du partekatua `prometheus` Zerbitzu-sarrera, prometeo-rola bere nginx + docker-osasuneko kablea oso-osorik dago, eta jatorrizko metrikek kontratua urratzen dute. (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) rolen zuhaitzaren gainean dago."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the role dependency graph expressed via `meta/main.yml`: declared `dependencies:` targets MUST exist, the `dependencies:` graph MUST be acyclic, and meta dependencies MUST NOT be declared when a guarded `include_role` / `import_role` would suffice."
msgstr "Rolaren mendekotasun-grafikoaren aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak `meta/main.yml`: `dependencies:` helburuak existitu behar dira, `dependencies:` Grafikoak ziklikoak izan behar du, eta meta-mendekotasunak ez dira deklaratu behar zaintzapean daudenean. `include_role` / `import_role` Aski litzateke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce per-role invariants of the unified ``services.sso`` block across roles, including normalization of ``allowed_groups`` paths and allocation of per-consumer SSO-proxy ports."
msgstr "Bateratutakoaren aldaezinak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak ``services.sso`` blokeetan zehar rolak, normalizazioa barne ``allowed_groups`` SSO-proxy portuen bide-izenak eta esleipena."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce role naming conventions: folder names match the declared category prefix (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, …), and roles do not collide on canonical identifiers."
msgstr "Rolak izendatzeko konbentzioak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak: karpeta-izenak kategoria-aurrizki deklaratuarekin bat datoz (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`,...), eta rolek ez dute identifikatzaile kanonikoekin topo egiten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce rules about roles which represent deployable applications: `web-app-*` roles MUST ship a `README.md` (required for the Web App Dashboard), every literal name compared against `group_names` in playbooks/roles MUST resolve to a real `application_id`, every `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` reference MUST name an existing application, and roles MUST NOT reach into `applications[...]` by subscript; they MUST use `lookup('applications', …)` or `utils.roles.applications.config.get` instead."
msgstr "Aplikazio zabalgarriak ordezkatzen dituzten rolei buruzko arauak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak: `web-app-*` rolek itsasontzi bat behar dute `README.md` (Web App Dashboarderako beharrezkoa), Izen literal guztiak, haren aldean `group_names` liburu/liburuetan benetako erabaki bat hartu behar da `application_id`, bakoitza `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` erreferentzia existitzen den aplikazio bat deitu behar da, eta rolak ez dira bete behar. `applications[...]` azpiindizearen arabera; erabili egin behar dira `lookup('applications', …)` edo `utils.roles.applications.config.get` Horren ordez."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce safe handling of secrets across roles: env-file values MUST be quoted, shell tasks MUST quote password expansions, and password *definitions* MUST NOT apply the `quote` filter (which corrupts the stored value)."
msgstr "Rolen bidez sekretuak modu seguruan maneiatzen dituzten integrazio-probak: fitxategi-balioak aipatu behar dira, shell-eko atazek pasahitzaren hedapena eta pasahitza aipatu behar dituzte. *Definizioak* Ez da aplikatu behar. `quote` iragazkia (gordetako balioa hondatzen duena)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce structural invariants of every role under `roles/`: folder-name conventions and `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence."
msgstr "Eginkizun bakoitzaren aldaezin estrukturalak ezartzen dituzten integrazio-probak `roles/`: karpeta-izenen konbentzioak eta `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` helburu-izatea."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` and the roles that require a container network: subnets MUST be valid, unique, and non-overlapping, network names MUST map to an `application_id`, and every role that ships a `compose.yml.j2` with an `application_id` MUST have a network entry under `defaults_networks.local`."
msgstr "arteko kontratua indartzen duten integrazio-probak `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` eta edukiontzi-sare bat behar duten rolak: azpisareak baliozkoak, bakarrak eta ez-gainjarriak izan behar dira, sareko izenak mapatu behar dira. `application_id`, eta bat untziratzen duen paper bakoitza `compose.yml.j2` batekin `application_id` Sareko sarrera bat eduki behar du azpian `defaults_networks.local`."

msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between a role's `services[*].backups.*` configuration and the backup infrastructure (enabled flag, `stop_required`, image consistency)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between a role's folder name, its `application_id` in `vars/main.yml`, and the invokability classification from `plugins/filter/invokable_paths.py`."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak, paper baten karpeta-izenaren eta haren arteko kontratua indartzen dutenak `application_id` barruan `vars/main.yml`, eta ezeztagarritasunaren sailkapena `plugins/filter/invokable_paths.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the dashboard-tile scope rule: only `web-app-*` roles may declare `dashboard.{enabled,shared}` truthy; non-`web-app-*` roles MUST drop the entry or ship a static `dashboard: { enabled: false, shared: false }`."
msgstr "Nabigazio-esparruaren araua betetzen duten integrazio-probak: `web-app-*` Rolek deklaratu dezakete `dashboard.{enabled,shared}` egia; ez...`web-app-*` Rolek sarrera edo ontzi estatikoa askatu behar dute `dashboard: { enabled: false, shared: false }`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the shape and uniqueness of `domains.{canonical,aliases}` across all roles and validate that `get_domain()` references point to real `application_id`s."
msgstr "Integrazio-probak, forma eta berezitasuna ezartzen dutenak `domains.{canonical,aliases}` rol guztietan eta balioztatu hori `get_domain()` erreferentzia errealetara `application_id`s."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that exercise custom Ansible action plugins end-to-end through real playbook runs (e.g. retry behavior of `uri` / `get_url` wrappers)."
msgstr "Integratze-probak, ekintza-plugin pertsonalizatuak egiten dituztenak, erreprodukzio-liburuen bidez amaitzen dira. (adibidez, berriro saiatzea portaera `uri` / `get_url` itzulipurdikariak)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that pin the `meta/services.yml` ↔ `templates/playwright.env.j2` ↔ `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parity contract: every enabled service surfaces as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=`, every env line is consumed by a gating helper in the spec, and `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` / `# nocheck: playwright-service-gate` are the only suppressions."
