msgid "Neither correction works alone, which is why both ship. Declaring 8192 while still estimating 5461 leaves the model eligible; estimating 8192 while still declaring 16384 does the same. Together the demand becomes 8192 plus the 16 output tokens, which exceeds the honest window and excludes the route. The constant is therefore `services.litellm.router.min_chars_per_token`, named as a floor rather than an average, and it is rendered into both the hook and the probe so the two cannot drift."
