msgid "Runner pool: `svc-runner` gets a `local` flavor with no GitHub registration, jobs submitted by make, the worktree mounted instead of checked out, and a hold mode that keeps the job's DinD stack after the deploy for `compose-exec` and `compose-inner-run` iteration until a make target releases it. The infra inventory deploys one runner stack with N runners. Every local test deploy runs as a runner job with its own DinD (unique subnet, names and volume, as `svc-runner` does per CI job). CI deploys use the same job entry script. The pool replaces the per-worktree slot scheme for deploys after a live proof."
