msgid "SeaweedFS honours a public-read object or bucket ACL on an unsigned read unless a bucket policy explicitly denies it first. A bare ``Principal: \"*\"`` deny would also hit the consumer's own signed and presigned requests; the ``Null`` condition on ``aws:username`` limits it to unsigned ones, because SeaweedFS derives that key from a signed caller's IAM user ARN and evaluates an unsigned request as principal ``*`` without it."
