msgid "Single sign-on is wired in by default whenever the upstream software supports it: the role MUST configure OIDC against [web-app-keycloak](../../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/) when an OIDC client adapter exists upstream, and MUST configure LDAP against [svc-db-openldap](../../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/) when an LDAP adapter exists upstream. If a role offers both, it MUST default to OIDC and MAY expose LDAP behind a service flag. Roles whose upstream ships neither MUST document the exception in their `README.md`."
msgstr "Sinatzeko saio bakarra lehenetsi gisa kableatzen da goranzko softwareak onartzen duen bakoitzean: rolak OIDC konfiguratu behar du [web-app-keycloak](../../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/) OIDC bezero-moldagailu bat ibaian gora dagoenean eta LDAP konfiguratu behar denean [svc-db-openldap](../../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/) LDAP moldagailu bat ibaian gora dagoenean. Rol batek biak eskaintzen baditu, OIDCk lehenetsi beharko du eta LDAP zerbitzu-banda baten atzean utzi. Itsas gaineko ontziek ez dute salbuespenik dokumentatu behar. `README.md`."

