# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source for the args shared by the standalone provider stack (``compose.yml.j2``) and the local sidecar (``service.yml.j2``). ``-ip=localhost`` is deliberate: the all-in-one server otherwise advertises the auto-detected swarm ingress IP, which is unreachable for gRPC and hangs ``weed shell`` during bucket provisioning."
msgstr "Iturri bakarra hornitzailearen pilak partekatzen dituen arg-entzako (``compose.yml.j2``) eta alboko kotxea (``service.yml.j2``). ``-ip=localhost`` nahita egiten da: zerbitzari osoak, bestela, IP ingresa automatikoki detektatua iragartzen du, gRPCrako atziezina eta esekia. ``weed shell`` ontzi-hornikuntzan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source for the two consumers that must agree: ``extend_inventory`` turns the placements into inventory groups, and ``matrix`` turns the same placements into ``remote-2-local.backup_providers``. Exception: the group membership is also what runs ``user-backup`` on that node, so a node named as a provider without its group has no authorized pull key, and ``roles/svc-bkp-remote-2-local/templates/script.sh.j2`` counts one error per failing provider and exits 1 for the whole unit."
msgstr "Bi kontsumitzaileentzako iturri bakarra ados egon behar duena: ``extend_inventory`` lekuak inbentario talde bihurtzen ditu, eta ``matrix`` posizio berak bihurtzen ditu ``remote-2-local.backup_providers``. Salbuespena: taldeko kide izatea ere da exekutatzen dena ``user-backup`` nodo horretan, beraz, hornitzaile gisa izendatutako nodo batek ez du baimendutako tira-teklarik, eta ``roles/svc-bkp-remote-2-local/templates/script.sh.j2`` hutsegite-hornitzaile bakoitzeko errore bat kontatzen du eta irten egiten da 1 Unitate osoarentzat."

