msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate admits only the `administrator` and `user` role groups, and `biber` holds neither, so the proxy refuses it before Snipe-IT renders. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end. [`files/playwright/test-rbac.js`](./files/playwright/test-rbac.js) asserts the refusal, then grants biber the `user` group and drives the admitted journey."
msgstr ""

msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate admits only the ``administrator`` and ``user`` role groups, and ``biber`` holds neither, so the proxy refuses it before Snipe-IT renders. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end. ```files/playwright/test-rbac.js`` <./files/playwright/test-rbac.js>`__ asserts the refusal, then grants biber the ``user`` group and drives the admitted journey."
msgstr ""

msgid "Snipe-IT's own use of `ldap_default_group` on account creation has no Playwright assertion, because the biber account the spec creates survives between runs; the reconcile branches (join, leave, promote, demote, create, default group) are covered only by `tests/unit/php/roles/web-app-snipe-it/files/apply/RbacSyncTest.php`. Options: delete the biber account at the end of `files/playwright/test-rbac.js`, or assert the group on an account the spec names per run."
msgstr ""

