# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Still open: MCP calls carrying that identity, and the obstacle is upstream rather than a piece of this platform nobody wrote yet. [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) already fixes the bar: `auth_subject: user` may be set only after the exact client and server prove authorization-code or token-exchange behaviour, token refresh, audience binding, revocation and expiry. No MCP provider deployed here clears it — every server role authenticates as one `service_account`, because that is what its upstream offers — so `auth_subject: user` has nothing to resolve against. Meeting the bar means a provider gaining per-user OAuth upstream, not a credential model this repository can add on its own."
msgstr "Oraindik irekita dago: MCPk identitate hori daramala dio, eta oztopoa gorantz doa, inork idatzi ez duen plataforma honen zati baten ordez. [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) Dagoeneko konpontzen du barra: `auth_subject: user` Bezero zehatzak eta zerbitzariak baimen-kodea edo token-exchange portaera, tokenen freskatzea, audientzia-lotura, atzeratzea eta iraungitzea frogatu ondoren bakarrik ezar daiteke. Ez dago MCP hornitzailerik hemen hedatuta: zerbitzari-rol guztiak bat bezala identifikatzen dira `service_account`, Horregatik eskaintzen du bere upstream-ak, beraz `auth_subject: user` Ez dago zer konpondurik. Barra ezagutzeak esan nahi du hornitzaile bat irabazten ari dela OAuth korrontean gora, ez biltegi honek bakarrik gehi dezakeen kredentzial-eredu bat."

