msgid "That baseline is narrower than the truth. Its closure follows `run_after`, dependency and service edges, so a cross-role Jinja include is covered only where such an edge matches, and a renamed role path seeds only the new role. The plan lists changed paths with rename detection off, so a move counts both its old and its new path."
