msgid "The Playwright criterion \"a change of the changeable address stays pending until the confirmation link is followed\" still needs a spec, developed against a live stack. It needs no mailbox for the pending half: the `UPDATE_EMAIL` form, then the account API showing the old address. It must remove the pending change afterwards, because Keycloak re-adds `UPDATE_EMAIL` at every login while a pending address exists, which would stop every later biber login of every suite."
