msgid "The `biber` and `administrator` Playwright personas are gated on `services.sso.enabled`. When SSO is off, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Two reasons:"
msgstr "The `biber` eta `administrator` Playwright-eko pertsonak lotuta daude `services.sso.enabled`. SSO kanpoan dagoenean, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Bi arrazoi:"

