msgid "The agent syncs its whole home, transcripts included, unencrypted, to its Nextcloud. Before the upload every secret value is masked in the uploaded copy, so a leaked token, key or password never reaches the sync. The agent's own `.kdbx` is uploaded encrypted and is not touched by this redactor. Local deploys run with MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS disabled, so this redaction is the protective layer for what is synced."
