# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The list was held against the repository by three lints that parsed this section. They are gone, and the trade is deliberate: a lint that reads prose ties every role addition to an edit here, and the audit is a review record rather than a runtime registry. What they proved while they ran is worth keeping: the classification check named twenty-four roles whose audit entry contradicted their own metadata the first time it ran, nine of them shipping an adapter while the list still called them untried candidates. Without them, a role added later is absent here until someone notices."
msgstr "Zerrenda biltegiaren kontra gorde zuten atal hau analizatu zuten hiru lintsek. Joan egin dira, eta merkataritza deliberatua da: prosa irakurtzen duen lint batek paper bakoitza editatze batekin lotzen du, eta auditoria errebisio-erregistro bat da, exekuzio-erregistro bat baino gehiago. Exekutatu bitartean frogatu zutena gordetzea merezi du: sailkapen-egiaztapenak hogeita lau rol izendatu zituen, zeinaren ikuskapen-sarrerak bere metadatuen aurka egiten zuen lehen aldian, eta horietako bederatzik moldagailu bat bidaltzen zuten, zerrendak oraindik hautagai ez-trigatuak deitzen zituen bitartean. Beraiek gabe, hemen ez dago zereginik norbaitek ohartarazi arte."

