# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The result is stored on the stack host and rendered back into `model_info.traits.speed` on the same deploy, so the gateway restarts once with the numbers it just produced. A re-measured rate that moved less than 10% keeps its stored value, because no two runs measure the same machine and an unclamped result would restart the gateway for nothing. A model the measurement could not reach keeps its stored rate rather than losing it, so one bad minute does not unrank a model against its peers."
msgstr "Emaitza pila-ostalarian gordetzen da eta berriro itzultzen da `model_info.traits.speed` zabaldualdi berean, beraz, atebidea berriro hasten da behin sortu berri dituen zenbakiekin. Berriro neurtutako tasa bat, gutxiago mugitu dena 10%ak gordetzen du gordetako balioa, ezen bi exekuziok ez baitute makina bera neurtzen, eta emaitza ez da ezergatik atea berrabiarazten. Neurrira iritsi ezin den modelo batek gordetako tasa gordetzen du galdu ordez; beraz, minutu txar batek ez du modelorik askatzen bere kideen aurka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The resulting snippets cover every shared provider in the variant's closure, so the deploy stage finds the required `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` block in the inventory and `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` succeeds."
msgstr "Lortzen diren mozkinek aldagarriaren itxierako hornitzaile partekatu guztiak estaltzen dituzte, beraz, zabaltze-fasak behar den guztia aurkitzen du. `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` inbentarioan blokea eta `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` lortzen du."

# translated-by: libretranslate
