msgid "The upstream `oauth2-proxy` MUST set `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` and `X-Forwarded-Email` on every request that reaches the broker. The broker keys every account on `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` alone and never reads `X-Forwarded-User`, which carries the e-mail address. Without `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, the broker returns HTTP 401, there is no anonymous fallback by design."
