# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) on Arch Linux systems. GCC is a standard compiler suite supporting C, C++, and other programming languages. It is a core component for compiling and building software from source."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek GNU Compiler Collection instalatzen du (GCC) Arch Linux sistemetan. GCC konpilatzaile-suite estandar bat da, C++ eta beste programazio-lengoaia batzuk onartzen dituena. Iturburutik softwarea konpilatzeko eta eraikitzeko funtsezko osagaia da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the Intel VA-API media driver for the current Linux distribution."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek Intel VA instalatzen du...API multimedia-kontrola Linuxen banaketarako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek instalatzen du [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) mahaigaineko bezeroa Arch Linux sistemetan erabiltzeko [AUR (Arch Arch User Biltegia)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek instalatzen du `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ mahaigaineko bezeroa Arch Linux sistemetan erabiltzeko `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role is responsible for installing GnuCash, a free and open-source financial management software, on systems utilizing the Pacman package manager. It's particularly useful for setting up GnuCash in a Linux environment with minimal manual intervention."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible hau instalatzeaz arduratzen da. GnuCashSoftware libre eta kode irekikoa Pacman pakete-kudeatzailea erabiltzen duten sistemetan. Oso erabilgarria da konfiguratzeko. GnuCash Linux ingurune batean, esku-hartze minimoarekin."

