# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` or a ``repository/url`` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
msgstr "Onartutako banaketa da, ez gainbegiratzea. Moodle-k ez du sarbide-zerrendarik eskaintzen, beraz, barneko ostalari bakar bat ezin da baimendu bertan dagoen barrutia desblokeatu gabe. Kostua da URLak harrapatzeko gaitasuna duen edozein kontu, adibidez ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` edo ``repository/url`` adibidez, zerbitzariaren jaulkipenak eskaerak egin ditzake edukiontziak nahasteko. Baimendu gaitasun horiek irispide horrekin fidatzen zaren roletan bakarrik, edo mantendu upstream zerrenda eta onartu SSOren saio-hasierak eta AAren gainazalak ez duela funtzionatzen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
