# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes the design of the Infinito.Nexus RBAC layer that provisions LDAP groups, synchronises them to Keycloak, and emits them as the OIDC `groups` claim. For IAM fundamentals that span both providers, see [common.md](common.md). For the LDAP server layer, see [ldap.md](ldap.md). For the OIDC client layer, see [oidc.md](oidc.md). Operator-facing steps live in [Administration RBAC](../../../administration/configuration/rbac.md)."
msgstr "Orri honek diseinua azaltzen du Infinito.Nexus RBAC geruzak LDAP taldeak hornitzen ditu, sinkronizatzen ditu Keycloaketa OIDC gisa igortzen ditu `groups` Erreklamazioa. Bi hornitzaileei eusten dieten IAMen oinarriak, ikus [common.md](common.md). LDAP zerbitzariaren geruzarako, ikus [ldap.md](ldap.md). OIDC bezeroaren geruzarako, ikus [oidc.md](oidc.md). Operadorearen urratsak bizi dira [Administrazioa RBAC](../../../administration/configuration/rbac.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
