# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the contract of the `email` Ansible lookup plugin and the rules contributors MUST follow when extending it or consuming it from a role. For administrator-facing configuration (keys, override variables, precedence), see [email.md](../../../../administration/configuration/email.md)."
msgstr "Orrialde honek kontratua aurkezten du `email` Bilatzeko plugin ansibleak eta arauen laguntzaileek jarraitu behar dute hedatu edo paper batetik kontsumitu. Administratzailearen konfigurazioa (gakoak, aldagai gainjarriak, lehentasuna), Ikusi [email.md](../../../../administration/configuration/email.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the permission and runtime configuration in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). For the trust assumptions and the two-layer containment model behind these rules, see [security.md](security.md). For the OS-level sandbox configuration, see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md). For general agent workflow rules, see [common.md](../common.md). For the Claude Code reference, see [docs.claude.com](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/settings)."
msgstr "Orrialde honek baimen eta exekuzio-orduen konfigurazioa zehazten du [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). Fidagarritasun-suposizioak eta bi geruzako edukitze-eredua arau horien atzean, ikus [security.md](security.md). OS mailako sandbox konfiguraziorako, ikus [sandbox.md](sandbox.md). Eragile orokorren lan-fluxuaren arauetarako, ikus [common.md](../common.md). Claude Code erreferentzia, ikusi [docs.claude.com](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/settings)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the rules that govern the top-level [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) and the environment variables it consumes. For general documentation rules (links, writing, RFC 2119 keywords), see [documentation.md](../../documentation.md). For CI debugging workflows that use these variables, see [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md)."
msgstr "Orri honek goi-mailako arauei buruzko informazioa ematen du. [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) eta kontsumitzen dituen ingurune-aldagaiak. Dokumentazio-arau orokorrak (estekak, idazketa, RFC 2119 gako-hitzak)Ikusi [documentation.md](../../documentation.md). Aldagai hauek erabiltzen dituzten lan-fluxuak arazteko, ikus [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page enumerates the trust assumptions that the Claude Code configuration in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json) relies on. If any assumption becomes false on a given host, the corresponding rule in [settings.md](settings.md) or [sandbox.md](sandbox.md) MUST be re-evaluated before Claude Code is started. This file is the single reference for the architectural reasoning. Per-rule tables in the neighbouring pages summarise the mechanics and link here for the full argument."
msgstr "Orrialde honek Claude Kodearen konfigurazioaren fidagarritasun-suposizioak zerrendatzen ditu [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json) Horretan oinarritzen da. Edozein suposizio faltsu bihurtzen bada ostalari jakin batean, dagokion araua [settings.md](settings.md) edo [sandbox.md](sandbox.md) Berriro aztertu behar da Claude Code hasi aurretik. Fitxategi hau arrazoibide arkitektonikoaren erreferentzia bakarra da. Ondoko orrialdeetako arauzko mahaiek mekanika laburtzen dute eta hemen estekatzen dute argumentu osoa lortzeko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page enumerates the values the `meta/services.yml.<entity>.lifecycle` key MAY take and what each value commits the project to. The on-disk shape of `lifecycle` itself is documented in [layout.md](layout.md); this page is the semantic counterpart."
msgstr "Orrialde honek balioen zerrenda egiten du `meta/services.yml.<entity>.lifecycle` gakoa hartu eta balio bakoitzak proiektuari ematen diona. Diskoaren forma `lifecycle` bera dokumentatuta dago [layout.md](layout.md); Orrialde hau kontraparte semantikoa da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page explains how Infinito.Nexus is put together so contributors know where a change belongs and why the repository is shaped the way it is."
msgstr "Orri honek azaltzen du nola Infinito.Nexus Elkartzen da, beraz, laguntzaileek badakite aldaketa non dagoen eta biltegia nola moldatuko den."

