msgstr "Orrialde hau SPOT administrazioa da, aplikazio-errendimenduak emateko eta errebokatzeko. Keycloakestaltzen du **nola**; **zergatik?** (diseinua, eskema, LDAP diseinua, bezeroarenscope kontratua) Ikusi [RBAC diseinua](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page lists every repository secret that GitHub Actions workflows in this repository consume, and documents the failure mode when a secret is missing. For repository **variables** see [configuration.md](configuration.md). For the workflow catalog see [workflows.md](workflows.md)."
msgstr "Orrialde honek GitHub Ekintzak biltegi honetako lan-fluxuak kontsumitzen dituen sekretu guztiak zerrendatzen ditu, eta hutsegite-modua egiaztatzen du sekretu bat falta denean. Biltegirako **aldagaiak** Ikusi [configuration.md](configuration.md). Lan-fluxuaren katalogorako, ikus [workflows.md](workflows.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page lists every repository variable that controls GitHub Actions CI behaviour in this repo. For the workflow catalog see [workflows.md](workflows.md); for the CI flow see [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Orrialde honetan GitHub Ekintzak CIren portaera kontrolatzen duen biltegi-aldagai guztiak zerrendatzen dira. Lan-fluxuaren katalogoa ikusteko [workflows.md](workflows.md); CI emaria ikusteko [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page owns framework and runner mechanics only. The procedure for writing, deploying, and reviewing a role-local spec lives in the dedicated SPOTs:"
