# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "[Hermes agentea](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) Agente autonomoa da. Funtzio honek modu gorpuztatuan exekutatzen du: hari eskainitako makina batean, makina horren hardwarerako sarbide zuzenarekin. Edukiontzien paperek nukleoaren muga jartzen dutenean agentearen eta ostalariaren artean, hemen muga gailua bera da."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "[Etxeko laguntzailea](https://www.home-assistant.io/) Iturburu irekiko etxeko automatizazio-plataforma bat da, etxe adimenduneko gailuak interfaze lokal bakar baten atzean hornitzaile askotatik konektatzen dituena. Gailuen egoera, arbelak eta makinaren automatizazio arauak mantentzen ditu, eta web interfaze baten bidez, REST baten bidez erakusten ditu. APIeta MCP zerbitzari barneratua."

