# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Kata Containers](https://katacontainers.io/) is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single `runsc` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "[Kata Edukiontziak](https://katacontainers.io/) OCI edukiontziaren exekuzio-denbora bat da, edukiontzi bakoitza makina birtual arin batean abiarazten duena bere nukleoarekin, ostalariaren nukleoa partekatu ordez. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) bigarren geldialdia da, bakar gisa bidalita `runsc` Bitarra, edukiontziaren dei-deiak atzematen dituena erabiltzaile-espazioko nukleo batean eta hardwarearen birtualizaziorik gabe exekutatzen dena."

