# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] [web-app-wordpress](../../roles/web-app-wordpress/) is audited for a maintained MCP plugin and is integrated only after the plugin's update cadence, license, authentication, and tool scope are documented. The plugin is [WordPress/mcp-adapter](https://github.com/WordPress/mcp-adapter), which bridges the Abilities API to MCP. **Maintained:** owned by the WordPress organisation, not archived, last pushed 2026-08-28. **Cadence:** eight releases between 2025-08-14 and 2026-08-13; the role pins `v0.5.0` (2026-04-15) while `v0.6.1` is current, so the pin trails by two minor versions and is the first thing to revisit. **Licence:** GPL-2.0. **Authentication:** a WordPress application password held in the token store, behind `is_user_logged_in()` and a per-ability permission callback. **Tool scope:** the role registers three read abilities of its own — `infinito/search-posts`, `infinito/get-post`, `infinito/list-categories` — rather than exposing core or third-party abilities, and `files/playwright/addons/infinito-mcp-abilities.spec.js` asserts that exactly those are reachable and that an anonymous `tools/list` is refused. The surface ships `enabled: false`, so it is an operator opt-in."
msgstr "[x] [web-app-wordpress](../../roles/web-app-wordpress/) MCP plugin batentzako ikuskatzen da, eta pluginaren eguneratze-kadentzia, lizentzia, autentifikazioa eta tresna-esparrua dokumentatu ondoren bakarrik integratzen da. Plugina da [WordPress/mcp-adapter](https://github.com/WordPress/mcp-adapter), Gaitasunak zubitzen dituena API MCPri. **Mantenduta:** jabea WordPress antolaketa, ez artxibatua, azken bultzada 2026-08-28. **Cadence:** zortzi argitalpenen artean 2025-08-14 eta 2026-08-13; paperaren pinak `v0.5.0` (2026-04-15) bitartean `v0.6.1` korrontea da, beraz, pina bi bertsio txikiren bidez doa, eta lehen gauza da berriro aztertzea. **Lizentzia:** GPL...2.0. **Autentifikazioa:** a WordPress aplikazioaren pasahitza token biltegian, atzean `is_user_logged_in()` eta itzulgarritasunaren baimena. **Tresna-esparrua:** Rolak bere kabuz irakurtzeko hiru gaitasun erregistratzen ditu: `infinito/search-posts`, `infinito/get-post`, `infinito/list-categories` - core edo hirugarrenen gaitasunak erakustea baino, eta `files/playwright/addons/infinito-mcp-abilities.spec.js` baieztatzen du horiek eskura daitezkeela eta anonimoa dela `tools/list` Ez da onartzen. Gainazaleko ontziak `enabled: false`, Beraz, operadorearen aukera da."

