# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ Agente autonomoa da. Funtzio honek modu gorpuztatuan exekutatzen du: hari eskainitako makina batean, makina horren hardwarerako sarbide zuzenarekin. Edukiontzien paperek nukleoaren muga jartzen dutenean agentearen eta ostalariaren artean, hemen muga gailua bera da."

