# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ Iturburu irekiko etxeko automatizazio-plataforma bat da, etxe adimenduneko gailuak interfaze lokal bakar baten atzean hornitzaile askotatik konektatzen dituena. Gailuen egoera, arbelak eta makinaren automatizazio arauak mantentzen ditu, eta web interfaze baten bidez, REST baten bidez erakusten ditu. APIeta MCP zerbitzari barneratua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ Go-n idatzitako gune estatiko bizkor bat da. Funtzio honek bat osatzen du Hugo edozein upstream gunetik Git biltegia (lehenetsia: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) irudiz landutako denboran eta errendatutakoan HTML/CSS/JS nginx bidez. Ez dago datu-baserik, ez aplikazio-zerbitzaririk, ez motor dinamikorik exekuzio-denboran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` - lineaz bereizitako bide-izenak, konkurrentzi-taldeko kideak babesten dira. Hori gabe, laguntzaileek ere bertan behera utziko lituzkete inoiz gobernatu gabeko taldeak, adibidez `cron-*` entzuten diren lan-fluxuak `push`. Kendu zerrendatik `concurrency:` blokeak, ez itxuraz zerikusia dutenak: `entry-delete-branch.yml` taldearen gakoak *ezabatuta* erref, beraz, ez da push talde bateko kidea eta zerrendatzea bultzada bat litzateke. `main` bertan behera utzi adarrik gabeko garbiketa. Bide-izenik ez duen balioa abortatu egiten da isilik ezerekin bat egin ordez."

