msgid "`Incus <https://linuxcontainers.org/incus/>`__ is a manager for system containers and virtual machines. It runs QEMU/KVM virtual machines with their own kernel, stores their disks in copy-on-write storage pools and exposes everything through a REST API that clients reach with TLS client certificates."
