msgid "``sso`` renders the ``OPENID_CONNECT_*`` block of `templates/env.j2 <./templates/env.j2>`__. With it Greenlight v3 shows one Sign In button that posts to Keycloak and no Sign Up, and its API refuses every local sign-in except a SuperAdmin’s and every local sign-up. Greenlight finds the account by ``external_id``, the token’s ``sub`` (``OPENID_CONNECT_UID_FIELD=sub``), and never by e-mail (``USE_EMAIL_AS_EXTERNAL_ID_FALLBACK=false``); `files/ruby/greenlight/ensure_admin.rb <./files/ruby/greenlight/ensure_admin.rb>`__ gives the administrator the Keycloak id that `roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/utils/directory_users.yml <../web-app-keycloak/tasks/utils/directory_users.yml>`__ reads at deploy."
