msgid "`sso` renders the `OPENID_CONNECT_*` block of [templates/env.j2](./templates/env.j2). With it Greenlight v3 shows one Sign In button that posts to Keycloak and no Sign Up, and its API refuses every local sign-in except a SuperAdmin's and every local sign-up. Greenlight finds the account by `external_id`, the token's `sub` (`OPENID_CONNECT_UID_FIELD=sub`), and never by e-mail (`USE_EMAIL_AS_EXTERNAL_ID_FALLBACK=false`); [files/ruby/greenlight/ensure_admin.rb](./files/ruby/greenlight/ensure_admin.rb) gives the administrator the Keycloak id that [roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/utils/directory_users.yml](../web-app-keycloak/tasks/utils/directory_users.yml) reads at deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "`sso` renders the `WEBLATE_SOCIAL_AUTH_OIDC_*` backend; `WEBLATE_REGISTRATION_ALLOW_BACKENDS=oidc` lets a Keycloak sign-in create its account while local registration is closed. A sign-in reaches an existing account only through its `oidc` link keyed by the token's `sub`, never by e-mail: [files/python/settings_override.py](./files/python/settings_override.py), mounted at `/app/data/settings-override.py`, drops `associate_by_email` from the pipeline, and [files/python/adopt_admin.py](./files/python/adopt_admin.py) links the administrator to the Keycloak id that [roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/utils/directory_users.yml](../web-app-keycloak/tasks/utils/directory_users.yml) reads at deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "`sso`: the Keycloak OAuth source (`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`, removed by `tasks/cleanup/oidc.yml` when off). With it on, `[oauth2_client] ENABLE_AUTO_REGISTRATION=true` creates the Gitea account at the first sign-in and `ACCOUNT_LINKING=auto` links a Keycloak identity to the existing account of the same username, so directory accounts synced by the LDAP source and the platform administrator sign in through Keycloak without a link page."
msgstr ""

msgid "`sso`: the Keycloak entry of `oidc_providers` (`templates/flavor/compose/synapse/homeserver.yaml.j2`, `matrix_synapse_oidc_*` in `templates/flavor/ansible/vars.yml.j2`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "`sso`: the `OAUTH_*` and `OPENID_*` block of the Keycloak client."
msgstr ""

