msgid "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` requires that Ansible `shell:` tasks stay on Bash and use Bash's `set -o pipefail` form, not the POSIX-`sh` workaround."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` eskatzen du Ansible `shell:` Zereginak Bash-en geratu eta Bash-en lana erabili `set -o pipefail` forma, ez POSIX-`sh` -Bai."

